<h1>Minecraft Art</h1>
<img src="nyanmine.png" alt="minecraft nyan cat">
<p>For my sculpture, I selected Nyan Cat. I feel she is stable and has staying power in the meme community; she was a perfect mix of the cat-video era, new digital media, and the humor of the time.
 It is also interesting that she bridged cultures, combining Western internet culture with Japanese Vocaloid. 
It was a big treat getting to build her, as when I was young, she was my obsession and the fuel for my love of cats. </p>

